IMAGE PIPELINE AND RELEASE RULES
A banner set: exactly two campaign sources, each exported PNG 1280 x 720 with watermark Q4 LAUNCH.
B product set: exactly two product sources, each exported PNG 800 x 1000 with watermark PRODUCT READY.
Use source images at least 1200 pixels on the longer side and with the required source aspect ratio.
Classify every source file as exported or excluded; exclusions require a concise reason.
Corrupt, undersized, or wrong-aspect sources must not be exported.
Submit to the local QA desk, correct each rejection, and resubmit the updated manifest.
The release is ready only after the QA desk records a passing receipt for the correct manifest revision.

